FrameTube is a simple page with YouTube iframe player.

If you have a link to a video like "https://youtube.com/watch?v=...", just
replace "youtube.com" domain with the FrameTube host, for example "127.0.0.1:8000".

YouTube API requires the webpage to be accessed from a server, so for
local usage, use a web server, for example python http.server.
